# Netlify-only maintenance-mode files. Vercel also understands the
# _redirects file format, so without this exclusion a `vercel deploy`
# could start applying the same catch-all "everything -> maintenance"
# rule here too — defeating the point of using Vercel as the full,
# always-browsable site for testing while friendlyrideinc.com (on
# Netlify) shows maintenance.
_redirects
maintenance.html
